This product includes software derived from bflb_flash_web, part of Bouffalo Lab's bouffalo_sdk:
    https://github.com/bouffalolab/bouffalo_sdk, folder tools/bflb_flash_web,
    commit 82efe4ef797e190880706f9cff1809b423e20847 (SDK release 2.3.37),
    licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).
The unmodified original files are in that commit of bouffalo_sdk, folder tools/bflb_flash_web.

Files modified from that original:
    index.html        rewritten user interface (English, two files with Sipeed / GitHub download buttons, BL616 only)
    app.js            page logic for the two-file Tango install; SerialTransport kept, messages translated
    loader.js         messages translated to English; no code change
    protocol.js       messages translated to English; no code change
    targets/bl616.js  messages translated to English; no code change
    targets/index.js  registers the BL616 target only
Unmodified copies of original files:
    targets/common.js, targets/bl616/flash_para.bin
Original files not included:
    README.md, .gitignore, targets/bl602.js, targets/bl602/*, targets/bl616cl.js, targets/bl616cl/*
Files added by Tango (not derived from bflb_flash_web):
    tango.js
    images/boot-button.png  a rendering of Sipeed's Tang Console 3D model (Sipeed Download Station), annotated to show the BOOT button and the MCU USB-C port
    fonts/SairaCondensed-SemiBold.ttf, fonts/OFL.txt (a separate third-party component, below)

